<h1>My Favorite Games</h1>

<p>
    These are some of the games I’ve spent the most time on and why I keep coming back to them.
</p>
<hr />
<ul>
    <li>
        <strong>Deadlock</strong> – I like how fast-paced it is and how much decision-making matters during fights.
        It feels rewarding when you play smart and outmaneuver people.
    </li>

    <li>
        <strong>League of Legends</strong> – Even though it can be frustrating sometimes, I enjoy the competitive aspect
        and improving over time. Every match feels different depending on the team and strategy.
    </li>

    <li>
        <strong>Minecraft</strong> – This is one of the most relaxing games for me. I like building things and just exploring
        without any pressure.
    </li>

    <li>
        <strong>Terraria</strong> – I enjoy the progression system a lot. Starting with nothing and slowly getting stronger
        and unlocking new gear is really satisfying.
    </li>
</ul>